abstract: >-
  Code for an unofficial, fan-made Makise Kurisu (STEINS;GATE) text-to-speech voice in
  Japanese, Mandarin Chinese and English: dataset build, a fixed Qwen3-TTS fine-tuning
  trainer, cross-lingual accent reduction with language ids and native replay, and a
  pre-registered evaluation.
